WEBVTT

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:42.060
I want to see you but I can't
see you because it hurts so much.

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:46.160
I'm sure I must
be missing something...

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:49.400
...and that's why my
prayer hasn't been answered.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:53.500
(Yami, the Hat and the Book traveler)
...and that's why my
prayer hasn't been answered.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:01:00.500
I had always believed
that what I saw before me...

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:07.300
...was the only truth there was.

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:15.130
But now I know
there isn't just one world.

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:24.600
There are a thousand worlds called
"if" and I don't know which way to turn.

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:30.500
I want to see you but
I can't see you; where are you now?

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:33.630
I'll find you no matter the cost.

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:41.400
I've wandered into the
labyrinth of your eyes.

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:45.330
Even if the darkness bars my path...

00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:51.330
...even if my weak heart
is led astray, I won't give up.

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:56.300
I'll keep searching for you.

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:17.130
Meirin

00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:26.730
Anyway, I gotta find
Princess Fuji, that's why I'm here.

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:30.660
So where is the princess?

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:35.330
Let's take a look
into the next room.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:39.400
That's my Meirin!

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:40.560
You've got sharp senses!

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:46.030
Now what?

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:50.930
I didn't plan
anything after we meet her.

00:02:54.630 --> 00:02:56.430
Quite the resemblance.

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:59.200
I am not surprised...

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:01.800
...considering
this is here as well.

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:02.830
Intruders!

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.260
Intruders!

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:07.400
Hazuki, my comb.

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:14.230
Did I do something wrong?

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:16.300
Why did you take it with you?

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:18.330
Because...

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:20.160
Wait here.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.230
Hazuki?

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:24.130
I'll be fine.

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:26.360
Hazuki!

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:00.930
Princess Hazuki!

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:26.360
Oh, princess!

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:51.630
We have captured Princess
Fuji of the bamboo fortress.

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:56.030
Well done.

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:19.460
How dare you!

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:32.500
Master!

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:39.030
How dare you kill my ninjas!

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:43.830
Ninja magic spider web!

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.860
Ninja magic Tatami flip!

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:55.160
What!?

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:01.600
Hazuki!

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:06.430
Do you think you can
beat my ultimate ninja magic?

00:06:07.730 --> 00:06:09.600
Ninja magic fire wheels!

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:12.500
Hazuki!

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:22.630
Now you will witness the
true power of the Shiranui clan?

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:24.800
Burn to ashes!

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:42.600
Why?

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:46.130
Why doesn't my
ninja magic work on you!?

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:50.800
Like I care!

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:53.400
I'm not gonna die!

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:03.360
I die with no regrets!

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:10.400
Princess!

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:15.360
Hazuki!

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:17.560
Where's my comb?

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:28.230
Huh?

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:31.130
My comb.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:36.960
It's not what it looks like...

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:37.500
Thank you.

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:42.060
You saved it, thank you.

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:52.960
I see, those ninjas
came here for this comb.

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:55.500
Yes, that's right.

00:07:58.860 --> 00:08:05.260
No doubt this comb must be the
source of the family's magical powers.

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:07.660
It's all that remains of Eve.

00:08:09.660 --> 00:08:12.030
As long as this comb is here,...

00:08:13.400 --> 00:08:15.760
...this fortress will
always be the target of attack.

00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:19.200
Princess Fuji's children,
their children and so on.

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:25.760
In every era, there will be people
who will strive for such treasure.

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:27.460
Right?

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:28.760
Aya?

00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:32.730
I am really not sure
but it could be that this object...

00:08:32.730 --> 00:08:35.560
...is too powerful for
any human to possess.

00:08:44.230 --> 00:08:48.360
You have come far from a
distant land I know nothing of.

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:54.660
I hope you can find a safe,
useful place for this comb.

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:56.060
Are you sure?

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:20.260
Oh, I didn't have
any fun this time.

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:22.660
Indeed, neither did I.

00:09:23.430 --> 00:09:25.460
I'm so tired.

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:29.830
Me, too.

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:34.000
I'm thirsty.

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:34.660
Gonna get some water.

00:09:39.230 --> 00:09:41.560
Oh, I want some, too!

00:09:53.830 --> 00:09:56.330
Huh, what is this place?

00:10:01.060 --> 00:10:04.060
Tip toe quietly, tip toe...

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:05.330
Excuse me!

00:10:06.530 --> 00:10:09.000
We definitely ain't spying on you!

00:10:11.030 --> 00:10:12.430
What are you doing here?

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:18.800
Fox witch Meirin, Sir Gargantua
wishes to speak with you.

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:20.260
Huh?

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:27.230
Welcome fox witch Meiren,
as I have summoned you.

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:32.260
What do you want from me?

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:35.600
It's of the utmost
importance, fox witch Meirin.

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:40.530
Now, hand over Eve's comb.

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:48.100
My soldiers have fully investigated
and inform me that you possess the comb.

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:51.830
Come, hand it over.

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:53.160
I don't have it.

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:56.330
Whaaat!?

00:10:57.030 --> 00:10:58.560
That doesn't belong to me.

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:02.760
You better double check
the next time you investigate.

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:13.830
How disappointing!

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:16.100
And to think I was
so close to ascertaining...

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:17.700
...another clue as to Eve's location.

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:19.960
What's with him?

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:22.830
He's so long winded.

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:30.530
Wait, I remember Eve was...

00:11:31.300 --> 00:11:35.330
Now, let's travel
through his past memories.

00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:39.730
Try not to get lost in the story.

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:50.160
Whoa!

00:11:50.160 --> 00:11:51.400
He's just my type.

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:02.500
So, what is it you want?

00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:06.730
The ultimate power of
eternal life, of course!

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:12.960
As you wish, but before that...

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:14.260
Here!

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:20.060
What's that?

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:23.230
Take a good long rest.

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:26.930
Am I dreaming?

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:29.330
Who do the hell do you think I am?

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.400
My name is Lilith.

00:12:32.030 --> 00:12:34.600
I am the omnipotent supreme
being who controls the world.

00:12:35.200 --> 00:12:37.000
If you doubt me, suit yourself.

00:12:37.600 --> 00:12:41.660
My apology, but it doesn't
have to be such a huge castle.

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:44.860
It can be any place
that I can just lay down.

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:46.530
How about that then?

00:12:57.400 --> 00:12:58.830
Meal time!

00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:05.200
I wasn't too sure what you liked,
so I brought a variety of dishes.

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:05.930
Oh?

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:18.100
He really does look like Yami.

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:20.830
Yummy!

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:31.060
This essence of aphrodisiac
will be the finishing touch!

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:33.900
When he eats it, he'll...

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:47.900
If you hold me so tight, you'll snap me!

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:49.660
What are you doing?

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:07.630
Um, I brought your meal...
you can have all you can eat.

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:13.160
I don't need dinner.

00:14:13.760 --> 00:14:15.300
I am ready to sleep instead.

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:17.230
Seriously?

00:14:18.260 --> 00:14:19.660
Don't say that.

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:20.730
Just give it a taste.

00:14:20.730 --> 00:14:21.700
No, you eat it.

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:26.500
I need him to eat or I'll be in trouble.

00:14:30.630 --> 00:14:31.660
Fine.

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:34.060
If you're going to have that
kind of attitude, watch out!

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:44.030
Jill.

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:45.260
Jill?

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:46.560
What woman is that?

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:55.430
Eve!

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:57.260
Oh my.

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:05.560
Stop it! My head!

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:08.630
My head feels like it's splitting!

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:12.900
I get the picture now.

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:15.760
It may hurt a little but be patient.

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:37.360
This is...

00:15:39.030 --> 00:15:42.500
I released your sealed memories.

00:15:44.760 --> 00:15:47.130
I didn't ask you to
show me such things!

00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:49.730
Please bear with me for a moment.

00:15:50.430 --> 00:15:51.930
I have my reasons.

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:54.530
Oh, don't miss the important part.

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:13.630
Jill's body disappeared?

00:16:14.460 --> 00:16:16.130
Finally, you remembered most of it?

00:16:17.430 --> 00:16:19.030
What just happened?

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:23.360
She looked like Jill but it wasn't.

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:27.300
That was actually Eve, my annoying
sister who causes me trouble...

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:29.200
...and travels different worlds.

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:30.360
Eve?

00:16:30.730 --> 00:16:31.600
That's right.

00:16:32.060 --> 00:16:36.830
You could say she's the source
of eternal life, "Super souma".

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:37.630
What!?

00:16:39.360 --> 00:16:40.830
Am I your type of girl?

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:42.830
Answer me!

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:46.630
Is Eve the reward in
return for my sacrifice?

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:51.130
Do you normally ask these questions
when you're in a position like this?

00:16:51.700 --> 00:16:52.930
Just answer me!

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:58.230
Eternal life is exactly
what I crave the most!

00:16:59.860 --> 00:17:02.430
With my powers, I can't control Eve.

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:05.160
You won't get anywhere with her.

00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:07.200
Why don't you just give up
on her before it's too late?

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:09.760
But you accepted my sacrifice.

00:17:10.600 --> 00:17:14.300
I know that, so this
is my gift in return.

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:17.400
I'll give you one of the worlds.

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:25.700
Are you mocking me?

00:17:42.860 --> 00:17:43.800
Where am I?

00:17:45.530 --> 00:17:46.600
You tricked me?!

00:17:46.860 --> 00:17:48.230
That's a mean thing to say.

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:51.630
I promised I would
give you a world, didn't I?

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:53.230
A world?

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:54.700
This void?

00:17:57.200 --> 00:18:01.700
You really know nothing
and you ask for eternal life?

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:03.030
What?

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:07.930
So strong and manly, I like that!

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:18.400
I can't move, what did you do to me?

00:18:19.800 --> 00:18:21.430
I don't like selfish people.

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:23.160
Now, chill out.

00:18:23.630 --> 00:18:28.760
I am sorry, I promise to behave,
now let me out of here!

00:18:29.530 --> 00:18:31.230
Will you obey me then?

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:32.460
Yes.

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:40.930
Where are we?

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:42.760
This is the book world.

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:45.860
There's nothing here,
which means everything is here.

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:51.360
If you can imagine the world
you want, you can be the creator.

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:56.100
Close your eyes.

00:19:03.300 --> 00:19:06.130
I see, this is what you wish.

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:17.200
It's not bad for your first time.

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:19.730
What is this?

00:19:19.730 --> 00:19:22.500
This is a world you
created all by yourself.

00:19:25.860 --> 00:19:27.630
It's not really to my taste.

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:33.360
Master! We've been waiting for you!

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:36.160
That hurts bro!

00:19:36.830 --> 00:19:38.430
Who are these monsters?

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:41.700
They're the servants you created.

00:19:42.400 --> 00:19:46.160
Since I don't see any women,
does that mean you like me?

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:51.530
I'm too shy to admit but
I do think am pretty cute.

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:54.860
Oh? Oh!?

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:04.200
I just want Eve!

00:20:04.630 --> 00:20:09.900
I will find Eve and get my
hands on the source of eternal life!

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:23.630
Fine, see if I care.

00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:31.500
How dare he fool me like this?

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:40.360
As you wish, I will find Eve,
but I'll never let you have her.

00:20:41.100 --> 00:20:44.500
And after I'm done using you,
I'll toss you aside!

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:49.030
Aya!

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:51.230
You can make all the mess you want...

00:20:51.230 --> 00:20:53.900
...but think of the person
who has to clean up after you- me.

00:20:54.360 --> 00:20:55.830
Did somebody dump you again?

00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:58.930
Nobody dumped me, I dumped him.

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:00.100
That bastard!

00:21:00.430 --> 00:21:01.360
I knew that.

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:06.060
But I'm still not
cleaning up that mess.

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:09.660
Why does everybody mock me!?

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:11.360
I'm angry!!

00:21:15.530 --> 00:21:19.630
This is the story of
Gargantua and Lilith's relationship.

00:21:20.400 --> 00:21:22.630
After getting his own world,...

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:29.000
...did Gargantua
become its lord or prisoner?

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:34.230
As long as the
wheel of fate keeps turning,...

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:36.560
...nobody knows the
truth about the future.

00:21:45.930 --> 00:21:53.360
I will offer up an eternal prayer.

00:21:53.630 --> 00:21:59.800
I will never give up on what matters.

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:07.260
I will go there, praying.

00:22:07.830 --> 00:22:14.100
No matter the distance
between us, I will catch you.

00:22:14.360 --> 00:22:21.930
That's a promise between you and I.

00:22:22.130 --> 00:22:29.260
Crying, cradling my memories,...

00:22:29.260 --> 00:22:35.760
...won't help even one
of my feelings to reach you.

00:22:37.360 --> 00:22:44.800
I will offer up an eternal prayer.

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:51.430
I will never give up on what matters.

00:22:53.400 --> 00:23:00.330
I will find the dawn
between you and I,...

00:23:01.130 --> 00:23:08.760
...and meet the approaching daybreak.

00:23:09.260 --> 00:23:14.000
I will go there, praying.

00:23:14.800 --> 00:23:17.300
Now it's time for
Lilith's tongue twister corner!

00:23:17.630 --> 00:23:18.930
Umm, she shells, she shrells...

00:23:18.930 --> 00:23:19.700
Peter Piper picked a peckle...

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:22.060
Uh, let's take a
look at the next book!

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:53.460
Next Time: Leila
Yami, the Hat and the Book Traveler.

00:23:53.460 --> 00:23:56.130
Please enjoy the next story as well.
